OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with occasionally heavy
OL,6,Frain spreading north through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Staying cloudy in the
OL,8,Fafternoon with further showery
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain, which will be heavy
OL,10,Fand perhaps thundery at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRather cloudy in the evening
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain, perhaps thundery at times. Rain
OL,15,Fovernight remains more persistent over
OL,16,Fthe Western Isles, dry interludes and
OL,17,Fshowers elsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
