OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FIt will remain cloudy with
OL,6,Ffurther showers or longer spells of
OL,7,Frain, often heavy. Fresh north to
OL,8,Fnortheasterly winds around the Western
OL,9,FIsles and the coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Ffew showers on Thursday morning but
OL,13,Fbecoming dry and bright in the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Mostly cloudy on Friday and
OL,15,FSaturday with showers or longer spells
OL,16,Fof rain at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
